  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_INTPA" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for International Partnerships</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LEAP 4 Dev - Lift up the Ecosystem and Amplify Philanthropy for development: Elevating philanthropy as a key partner in localisation and collaboration for the achievement of the 2030 Agenda.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This action aims at &lt;strong&gt;leveraging philanthropy&#xbf;s engagement, funding, influence and added value to implement the 2030 Agenda and become a strategic partner in development co-operation&lt;/strong&gt;, globally, but especially locally, in low- and middle-income countries. To reach this, it planned to (i) &lt;strong&gt;foster the enabling environment&lt;/strong&gt; in which philanthropy operates; (ii) &lt;strong&gt;strengthen local and regional ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt; that will accelerate impact and contribute to generating more domestic resources for civil society; and (iii) &lt;strong&gt;promote concrete alignment and investment&lt;/strong&gt; within philanthropy and with other sectors (multi-stakeholder &lt;strong&gt;partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;) &lt;strong&gt;to achieve the SDGs.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
